250
00:17:26,607 --> 00:17:30,996
for each link one control with the
video's worth of reasoning behind it in a

251
00:17:31,036 --> 00:17:35,776
sentence. It is careful about what is
sourced: it uses the post-mortem's facts and

252
00:17:35,816 --> 00:17:40,380
